  unitName: Bolt Mallet Elulu
  unitId: 40154
  unitNumber: 232
  description: "A young girl with the ability to control lightning. After toiling
    tirelessly to optimize her hammer, Elulu eventually succeeded in developing a
    model capable of discharging the same amount of energy as an actual bolt of lightning.
    When combined with an explosive burst of anti-gravity, Elulu\u2019s hammer released
    a force potent enough to cause seismic shifts. Those who saw her unleash a mighty
    blow with her hammer likened her to a goddess from a creation myth."
  summonDesc: Flash of lightning!<br>The roaring swing of the hammer!<br>I'll render
    all numb with my power!
  fusionDesc: Maximum voltage... <br>Output primed...<br>Full boost ahead!
  evoDesc: Upgrade complete!<br>Prepare to witness the ultimate<br>power of lightning!
